    question_en: "A global insurance provider, ApexSure Financial, operates a claims management web application hosted in the us-east-1 Region. Policyholders and adjusters worldwide frequently view and download claim evidence photos and PDF inspection reports stored in a private Amazon S3 bucket. Additionally, users submit claim forms and check claim settlement statuses through dynamic REST APIs (/api/*) hosted on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB).\n\nUsers accessing the application from Europe and Asia report high latency when retrieving claim documents and experiencing sluggish response times during claim submissions.\n\nWhich solution should a solutions architect recommend to minimize latency for both static and dynamic content globally with the LEAST operational overhead?",
