    question_en: "A retail chain operates a legacy inventory management application that requires custom software packages and must be deployed on Amazon EC2 instances. The system experiences steady 24/7 store transaction traffic with significant, unpredictable traffic surges during flash sales. The application requires access to an Amazon S3 bucket to archive transaction logs, stores relational inventory data with automatic failover, and requires daily automated database backups. A solutions architect must design a highly available architecture that complies with security best practices and requires the LEAST operational overhead.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
