      "summary": "Uploading files to Amazon S3 and using S3 Event Notifications to trigger an AWS Lambda function provides an event-driven, serverless architecture that processes files immediately upon upload. AWS Lambda scales automatically to handle unpredictable bursts of thousands of concurrent files without capacity planning, and charges only for actual execution duration, eliminating idle infrastructure costs and server management overhead.",
