    question_en: "A real-estate technology company operates a multi-account AWS environment managed by AWS Organizations to host its property listing platform. The platform stores sensitive property legal documents and high-resolution images across numerous Amazon S3 buckets in multiple AWS Regions. The company's compliance policy mandates that all S3 buckets across all existing and future member accounts must have server-side encryption enabled. Any bucket found without default encryption must be automatically remediated with minimal operational overhead. A solutions architect needs to design a centrally managed solution to enforce this requirement across all accounts and Regions.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
