    question_en: "A renewable-energy monitoring company ingests real-time telemetry from thousands of solar farms and wind turbines into an Amazon RDS for PostgreSQL database. During peak operating hours, operational dashboards and business intelligence tools execute heavy read queries for energy yield analytics, causing significant database performance degradation and impacting telemetry write transactions. The company requires a solution that offloads the analytical read traffic to improve performance and ensures the database has high availability with automatic failover in the event of an Availability Zone outage.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements with minimal administrative overhead?",
