      "Configure the factory gateways to upload files using standard single-part PUT requests. Configure default encryption on the S3 bucket using Server-Side Encryption with Amazon S3 managed keys (SSE-S3). Create an Amazon EventBridge rule that triggers an AWS Lambda function to delete failed upload attempts.",
      "Configure the factory gateways to upload files using S3 Multipart Upload. Configure default encryption on the S3 bucket using Server-Side Encryption with AWS KMS (SSE-KMS) and a customer managed key with automatic key rotation enabled. Add an S3 Lifecycle rule to abort incomplete multipart uploads."
