      "Configure the store systems to upload the archives to a staging bucket using Amazon S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR). Run the batch processing workload on Amazon EC2 Dedicated Hosts, and store static AWS credentials on an attached Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS) volume.",
