      "Deploy the application on an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 instances across multiple Availability Zones behind an Application Load Balancer. Deploy an Amazon RDS Multi-AZ DB instance with automated backups enabled for the database tier, and create an Amazon RDS Read Replica to offload read queries for claims adjuster inquiries."
